http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#Condition,condition,Condition,BioPortal: AURA,include,,,curated_ontology,native,unclear_model,"Merge of very different entities under condition: Aerobic, Condition, Allee-Effect, Anaerobic-Condition, Anhydrobiosis, Antibiotic-Resistance, Cold, Dormancy, Drug-Resistance, Electron-Configuration, Energy-Budget, Equilibrium, Flaccid, Hardy-Weinberg-Equilibrium, Heteromorphic, Metabolic-Disequilibrium, Obesity, Pain, Pesticide-Resistance, Phosphorylated, Polyspermy, Pregnancy, Psychotic, Season, Sleep, Stress, Torpor, Turgid",absent,absent,poor,good,1,high_confidence_include,MM,2026-07-03,,,,,no citation found
