http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/chronic-diease-patient-education-ontology#Disease,disease,Disease,BioPortal: CDPEO,include,,,clinical_terminology,native,unclear_model,"No comment, definition or superclass. No paper. The ontology description says: ""The constructed ontology mainly consists of two levels. Level 1 includes 5 terms: demographic, disease, vital sign, lifestyle and medication, which describe the characteristics contained in the patient data, as well as the topics of education materials. Leve 2 contains the detailed elements for each Level 1 class.""",absent,absent,absent,good,1,,MM,2026-07-05,,,,,Although denoted ontology no object property is in use.
