http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HINO_0015722,disease,Disease,BioPortal: HINO,include,,,,native,entity_as_process,"is_a ino:human molecular pathway is_a ino:pathway is_a ino:interaction_network is a bfo:process. Thus, disease is a process with probably proteins as participant. Hence, ogms:disease and ino:disease are not equivalent although both are OBO ontologies. In this very narrow scope of disease as a pathway the definition seems sound but leaves the clinical view of disease totally untouched and unreusable for this use case.",good,good,good,good,2,,MM,2026-07-06,,,,,
